ch'eng huang shadow~
Ch'eng-huang~
A shadow passes before your eyes.
~
   Vague and mysterious, its shifting countenance makes it difficult to 
discern this shadowy being as anything beyond humanoid. The guardian
protector, the holy warden of disaster and catastrophe, protects all within 
the city under its care. She grants the blessing of rain in the midst of
drought, holds the land steadfast in the midst of an earthquake and finally,
at the end of all things, she guides the souls of the departed to the realms
of the gods.
~
