Bixia Yuanjin~
A pulse of light glides slowly past you.
~
   Like the rising of the great yellow orb from behind the darkest mountains,
the bringing of light to the land at the commencement of day, this tender
spirit blesses the birth of all creatures, as each emerges from utter darkness
to begin life in the warmth and light of day.
~
