Er-lang~
A large hound emerges from the stalks of bamboo.
~
   The guardian god of the Oshi sniffs and paws the ground while a low rumble
builds at the back of its throat. Brother of the Jade Emporer, Yu-huang, and
packleader of the Tian-gou, the Hounds of Heaven, this fearsome creature razes
the hounds against all creatures of evil intent.
~
